     3461           view
     3462           tt-dis-rule.deckey_two
     3463           in FRAME Dialog-Frame.
     3464           ENABLE
     3465           tt-dis-rule.deckey_two WHEN p-mode <> 'ПРОСМОТР':U
     3466           WITH FRAME Dialog-Frame.
     3467         END.
     3468         else do:
